Ported from
  apps/punisher-server            → cmd/punisher, internal/*, curriculum/, migrations/
                                    (PostgreSQL store rewritten for SQLite)
  apps/claude-gateway (gateway)   → internal/claudecli (runner, stream parser, two-lane limiter)
  packages/go-shared/llm, llmjson → internal/llm, internal/llmjson (subset)
  apps/web (Punisher screens)     → web/src/{widgets,features,entities,shared}/punisher
  packages/ui                     → web/src/shared/ui/kit (since replaced by @forgen-team/ui)
  packages/config (tokens, preset, theme, eslint) → web/src/styles, web/tailwind.preset.js
                                    (since replaced by @forgen-team/tokens, @forgen-team/tailwind-preset),
                                    web/src/shared/lib/theme.ts, web/eslint.config.js

